  "summary_en": "Commission staff working document assessing progress between July 2024 and March 2025 on 58 EU-level recommendations from the 2024 State of the Digital Decade. It covers connectivity, semiconductors, cloud/AI, skills, digital identity and public services; 4 recommendations show no progress and 28 limited progress. Embodied AI and robotics appear only incidentally.",
